---
title: "💬 Caso 1 — Prompt normal (sin tools)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 👤 Usuario
    participant APP as 📱 App
    participant LM as 🧠 LM Studio

    U->>APP: "Explicame el patron Repository"
    APP->>LM: POST /chat/completions<br/>(messages + tools disponibles)
    Note over LM: El modelo decide que NO<br/>necesita ninguna tool
    LM-->>APP: stream "El patron Repository es..."
    Note over APP: Renderiza tokens en vivo<br/>en la burbuja del assistant
    LM-->>APP: finish_reason = "stop"
    APP-->>U: 💬 Respuesta de texto
